/* Dear ImGui's enumerations, as CONSTANT(name): each becomes a module constant named without the "ImGui" (or "Im")
 * prefix, so ImGuiWindowFlags_NoResize is ImGui.WindowFlags_NoResize and ImDrawFlags_RoundCornersAll is
 * ImGui.DrawFlags_RoundCornersAll. The list follows third_party/imgui/imgui.h of the pinned version. */
